    },
    {
      "displayText": "阿羅拉！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "963F7F8562C9FF01001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這裡是\n阿羅拉的樣子的雷丘<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n推廣委員會！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "901988E1662F000A963F7F8562C976846A235B50768496F74E1800100001BE00000A63A85EE359D454E16703FF01001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……雖然說是委員會，\n成員只有我一個人就是了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "2026202696D671368AAA662F59D454E16703FF0C000A621054E153EA670962114E00500B4EBA5C31662F4E863002001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "來來，<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳知道地區形態嗎？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n雖然不管<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳知不知道，\n我都會擅自說下去就是了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F864F86FF0C00100003110000FF01014F6059B377E59053573053405F62614B55CEFF1F00100001BE01000A96D671364E0D7BA100100003110000FF01014F6059B377E54E0D77E59053FF0C000A621190FD670364C581EA8AAA4E0B53BB5C31662F4E863002001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有些寶可夢會受到地區的影響\n而改變樣子對吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67094E9B5BF653EF5922670353D752305730534076845F7197FF000A800C65398B8A6A235B505C0D5427FF01001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "像大家熟知的雷丘也是這樣，\n在阿羅拉地區會進化成不同的樣子。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "50CF59275BB6719F77E5768496F74E184E5F662F90196A23FF0C000A5728963F7F8562C95730534067039032531662104E0D540C76846A235B503002001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "與其說明哪裡不一樣，\n不如讓雷丘們比一比會更好。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "820751768AAA660E54EA88E14E0D4E006A23FF0C000A4E0D59828B9396F74E1850116BD44E006BD4670366F4597D3002001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以我有個提案！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n就讓<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的雷丘和\n我的阿羅拉的樣子的雷丘<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n打一場寶可夢對戰吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE562116709500B63D06848FF0100100001BE01000A5C318B9300100003110000FF01014F6059B3768496F74E18548C000A62117684963F7F8562C976846A235B50768496F74E1800100001BE00000A62534E0058345BF653EF59225C0D62305427FF01001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "準備好用<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的雷丘和\n我的阿羅拉的樣子的雷丘<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n打寶可夢對戰時，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n請來和我搭話喔。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6E965099597D752800100003110000FF01014F6059B3768496F74E18548C000A62117684963F7F8562C976846A235B50768496F74E1800100001BE00000A62535BF653EF59225C0D62306642FF0C00100001BE00000A8ACB4F86548C6211642D8A7155943002001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請讓<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的雷丘和\n我的阿羅拉的樣子的雷丘<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n打一場寶可夢對戰吧。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n雙方在同行隊伍各只帶1隻！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB8B9300100003110000FF01014F6059B3768496F74E18548C000A62117684963F7F8562C976846A235B50768496F74E1800100001BE00000A62534E0058345BF653EF59225C0D62305427300200100001BE01000A96D965B95728540C884C968A4F0D540453EA5E36003196BBFF01001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是阿羅拉的樣子的雷丘！\n牠看起來心情真好！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n但是對戰請帶1隻雷丘就好喔。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F963F7F8562C976846A235B50768496F74E18FF01000A7260770B8D774F865FC360C5771F597DFF0100100001BE00000A4F46662F5C0D62308ACB5E36003196BB96F74E185C31597D55943002001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊，是雷丘呢！那麼<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳要和\n我的阿羅拉的樣子的雷丘<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n打一場寶可夢對戰了嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF0C662F96F74E185462FF0190A39EBC00100003110000FF01014F6059B38981548C000A62117684963F7F8562C976846A235B50768496F74E1800100001BE00000A62534E0058345BF653EF59225C0D62304E8655CEFF1F001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不要",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D89810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請讓我向<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳推廣\n阿羅拉的樣子的雷丘！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB8B936211541100100003110000FF01014F6059B363A85EE3000A963F7F8562C976846A235B50768496F74E18FF01001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哪種雷丘都很棒，\n不過阿羅拉的樣子是不同屬性，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n所以不要感到困惑喔！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54EA7A2E96F74E1890FD5F8868D2FF0C000A4E0D904E963F7F8562C976846A235B50662F4E0D540C5C6C6027FF0C00100001BE00000A62404EE54E0D8981611F523056F060D15594FF01001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真是精彩的勝利……！但是\n阿羅拉的樣子的雷丘推廣委員會<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n接下來才要正式開始活動。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F662F7CBE5F69768452DD522920262026FF014F46662F000A963F7F8562C976846A235B50768496F74E1863A85EE359D454E1670300100001BE00000A63A54E0B4F86624D89816B635F0F958B59CB6D3B52D53002001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請讓我的阿羅拉的樣子的雷丘\n和<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的雷丘交換吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB8B9362117684963F7F8562C976846A235B50768496F74E18000A548C00100003110000FF01014F6059B3768496F74E184EA463DB5427FF01001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "交換",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EA463DB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不換",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D63DB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真可惜！但為了推廣委員會的活動，\n我會一直在這裡等<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F53EF60DCFF014F4670BA4E8663A85EE359D454E1670376846D3B52D5FF0C000A621167034E0076F45728901988E17B4900100003110000FF01014F6059B37684FF01001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雷丘雷丘來交換，\n阿羅拉的樣子廣流傳～♪<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96F74E1896F74E184F864EA463DBFF0C000A963F7F8562C976846A235B505EE36D4150B3FF5E266A001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我懂<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的心情！\n畢竟交換寶可夢會讓人覺得很不捨呢！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621161C200100003110000FF01014F6059B376845FC360C5FF01000A75627ADF4EA463DB5BF653EF592267038B934EBA89BA5F975F884E0D63685462FF01001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然阿羅拉的樣子很棒，\n但一般的雷丘也很迷人呢！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D67136963F7F8562C976846A235B505F8868D2FF0C000A4F464E00822C768496F74E184E5F5F888FF74EBA5462FF01001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雷雷雷～咿！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96F796F796F7FF5E54BFFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼，我要再次出發去旅行了！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我會前往阿羅拉地區，\n和許多阿羅拉的樣子的雷丘成為朋友，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n並向全世界推廣牠們……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n這正是推廣委員會的活動！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
